Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:38.75,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:43.92,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I in the dream of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:12.87,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1180,0)}All in for it all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:17.00,OPJP,,0,0,0,,失うものなど
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.71,OPJP,,0,0,0,,All in for it all
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:26.38,OPJP,,0,0,0,,あれは誰の夢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:31.39,OPJP,,0,0,0,,この世の全て　その手で総べて
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:36.43,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Are you happy now? What did you get to pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:41.52,OPJP,,0,0,0,,There was hope in your hands, When you played in the sand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:44.69,OPJP,,0,0,0,,もう何もないさ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:49.86,OPJP,,0,0,0,,愛も未来も
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:54.83,OPJP,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:03:00.16,OPJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)}Am I in the dream of a butterfly?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:38.75,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我是否在梦中化作了蝴蝶?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.75,0:01:43.92,OPCN,,0,0,0,,亦或是本就身处蝴蝶的梦境?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.53,0:02:12.87,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1180,0)}倾注一切  孤注一掷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:17.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,,又有什么可失去的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:20.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,倾注一切  孤注一掷
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.71,0:02:26.38,OPCN,,0,0,0,,那究竟是谁的梦境?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.38,0:02:31.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,将世间万物  皆由你之手执掌统治
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:36.43,OPCN,,0,0,0,,如今的你幸福吗?  你又为此付出了怎样的代价?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.43,0:02:41.52,OPCN,,0,0,0,,忆往昔于沙中嬉戏之时  你的掌心曾满载着希望
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:44.69,OPCN,,0,0,0,,而如今早已一无所有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:49.86,OPCN,,0,0,0,,不论是爱  还是未来  皆不复有
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.86,0:02:54.83,OPCN,,0,0,0,,我是否在梦中化作了蝴蝶?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:03:00.16,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,280)}亦或是本就身处蝴蝶的梦境?
